{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WELCOME TO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/About_Header.png?t=1746883264\" /><strong>In a glorious past, the kingdom of Meritons shone with wisdom and prosperity. But after centuries, the whole dynasty's been falling apart. The governance of the kingdom has crumbled, injustices have multiplied, and many citizens have been forced to leave a system that has become unfair and outdated.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/Header_-_Streets.gif?t=1746883264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unfairly blacklisted by the banks, you joined a small group in a camp near the city.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To survive, we\u2019ll have to help each other and stick to the camp rules. Food, water, electricity, cleaning, resource management and rat hunting. Everything counts!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/Header_-_Village_Help.gif?t=1746883264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>The camp\u2019s really basic, we\u2019ll need to upgrade it if we want to survive the winters. You\u2019ll help explore and discover new tools and techniques to craft improvements.\u00a0From shelter insulation to vegetable gardening to electrical systems, there's plenty to do!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/Header_-_Village_Help_2_Still.png?t=1746883264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outcasts, but not alone! You\u2019ll have plenty of missions to gain experience. Team up with your campmates for the riskiest tasks. High risk, high reward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/Header_-_Missions_Still.png?t=1746883264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Corruption rules, resources are running low, and the competition outside the camp is brutal. Don\u2019t let anyone push you around. You're going to have to fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/Header_-_Missions_2_Still.png?t=1746883264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Their system is falling apart. But to protect their power, the Meritons will use their media to smear your name.</strong>\u00a0<strong>Your last hope is to get attention on social media to make your cause heard: block the roads, feed the homeless, investigate, and expose state secrets! You have nothing left to lose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/extras/Header_-_Media.gif?t=1746883264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2320630?t=1746883264","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2320630?t=1746883264","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/2047209cbdd4411ab626d5730b8f14715f6924e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746883264","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320630/2047209cbdd4411ab626d5730b8f14715f6924e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746883264","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mu